[00:20.16]1. Ever loyal to Jehovah,
[00:26.16]Loyal love we wish to show.
[00:32.16]As a people, dedicated,
[00:38.97]His commands we want to know.
[00:45.31]His advice will never fail us,
[00:51.31]And his counsel we obey.
[00:57.98]He is loyal; we can trust him.
[01:03.98]From his side we’ll never stray.
[01:13.51]2. Ever loyal to our brothers,
[01:23.04]Sticking close in times of need.
[01:27.79]Ever caring, always trusting,
[01:32.54]Ever kind in word and deed.
[01:44.98]We show honor to our brothers
[01:51.36]And respect them from the heart.
[01:57.74]Ever loyal, ever closer,
[02:01.05]From their side we’ll never part.
[02:34.94]3. Ever loyal to their guidance
[03:08.83]When our brothers lead the way.
[03:17.83]When they give us clear direction,
[03:23.83]May we loyally obey.
[03:31.10]Then the blessing from Jehovah
[03:37.10]Will be ours to make us strong.
[03:43.10]When we’re loyal, ever faithful,
[03:50.10]To Jehovah we’ll belong.